{"id":"fca5455005daa120","group":"90","path":"90/90-cor-henkin-sentence.md","title":"Henkin Sentence Existence","display":"cor-henkin-sentence — Henkin Sentence Existence","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-cor-henkin-sentence","aliases":["90-cor-henkin-sentence"],"display":"cor-henkin-sentence — Henkin Sentence Existence","depends_on":["[[90-df-henkin-sentence]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-cor-henkin-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-cor-henkin-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-henkin-sentence — Henkin Sentence Existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4cc1405929acfc1\" href=\"?note=c4cc1405929acfc1\" title=\"90-df-henkin-sentence\">90-df-henkin-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>全部语法与可证性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的同一环境；涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 时，还使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 中已声明的有效公理化证明呈示，不从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span> 单独推定公理可枚举。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory satisfying the diagonal-lemma assumptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering and partial decoder)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span> (explicit sufficient assumptions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T\\)</span> (Henkin-sentence predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>对固定公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> 应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的所需双条件，再展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对角引理应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> 给出存在性；具体固定点等价及数码层级已封装在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>这里只断言 Henkin 句存在，不无条件断言它可证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"c4cc1405929acfc1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal","status":"resolved","id":"34b9d9e028267d9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":""